Package: gaapitchfinder
Type: Package
Title: GAA Pitch Location Data and Geospatial Analysis Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-05-05
Authors@R: c(
    person("Vincent", "Tennanty", email = "vinny93@live.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ryan", "McGuinness", role = "ctb", comment = "Original GAA Pitch Finder data")
    )
Description: Provides Gaelic Athletic Association (GAA) pitch location data 
    for Ireland and around the world, along with geospatial analysis functions. 
    Enables users to search for pitches, find nearest locations, calculate 
    distances, and visualize spatial patterns. The package includes a built-in 
    dataset of GAA pitch locations with coordinates, club information, and 
    geographic metadata. All functions work entirely offline after installation.
